<title>USA: Thermo Electron sees meeting $1.34 estimate.</title>
<headline>Thermo Electron sees meeting $1.34 estimate.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Electron Corp said on Wednesday it expects to meet analysts' consensus earnings per share estimate of $1.34 for full-year 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We're not going to disappoint Wall Street,&quot; the firm's investor-relations manager, Anthony Loumidis, told a meeting of the Atlanta Society of Financial Analysts.</p>
<p>The supplier of environmental monitoring and analysis instruments expects to announce actual full-year results on March 19.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
